# Platform Terminology

Use these exact terms consistently across all articles.

## Product Lines

| Canonical Name | Also Known As | Do NOT Use |
|----------------|---------------|------------|
| **Asset Sale** | Whole Loan Sale (WLS) | "Loan Sale", "Asset Transfer" |
| **Credit Facilities** | CF | "Credit Lines", "Lending" |
| **Securitization** | SEC | "Structured Products" |
| **Participation Agreements** | PA | "Participations" |

In UI-facing docs, prefer "Asset Sale" (the user-visible label).
In technical context, "Whole Loan Sale (WLS)" is acceptable.

## Roles

| Canonical Name | Context | Backend Value |
|----------------|---------|---------------|
| **Issuer / Borrower** | All product lines — creates pools, loans, deals, term sheets | `Issuer` |
| **Underwriter / Facility Agent** | Asset Sale (Underwriter) + Credit Facilities (Facility Agent) — same account, different label per module | `MarketMaker` |
| **Investor / Lender** | Asset Sale / Securitization (Investor) + Credit Facilities (Lender) — same account | `Investor` |
| **Servicer** | Post-close servicing — uploads loan tapes | `Servicer` |
| **Paying Agent** | Securitization — manages payment distributions | `PayingAgent` |
| **Verification Agent** | Batch verification / ABDP — reviews and certifies loan batches | `VerificationAgent` |
| **Admin** | Platform administration | `Admin` |
| **Rating Agency** | Pool review only (read access) | `RatingAgency` |

### Role display rules
- In general/platform-wide context: use **Underwriter / Facility Agent** (not "Market Maker")
- In Credit Facilities context specifically: use **Facility Agent**
- In Asset Sale context specifically: use **Underwriter**
- Never use "Market Maker" in user-facing documentation
- **Servicer** dashboard shows only Home / Dashboard split by transaction type (Securitization, Credit Facility, Asset Sale tabs) — no pool or loan management sidebar items

